ive."},{"name":"Homing Striker","noun":"ZelemBasicRangedHoming","slug":"zelembasicrangedhoming-noun","role":"Minion","challenge_value":8,"base_hit_points":22,"estimated_hit_points":73.5,"descriptions":["Fires projectiles that periodically home in on the closest hero.","The projectiles will expire after a short period of time."],"behavior":"Its retained-target projectile begins homing after one second and is bounded by the authored 18-unit lifetime."},{"name":"Haster","noun":"ZelemSpecialHaster","slug":"zelemspecialhaster-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":100,"estimated_hit_points":334,"descriptions":["Can bend time to haste a nearby ally's movement and attack speed.","Has a moderately damaging projectile attack."],"behavior":"It deterministically selects the nearest living ally inside range 30, falls back to itself only when alone, applies the exact 20-second movement/attack/cooldown haste, then fires its recovered projectile."},{"name":"Laser Unit","noun":"CitadelBasicRanged","slug":"citadelbasicranged-noun","role":"Minion","challenge_value":5,"base_hit_points":24,"estimated_hit_points":80.2,"estimated_damage_min":11.7,"estimated_damage_max":23.4,"descriptions":["Charges up, then fires a piercing laser bolt."],"behavior":"Its ranked wind-up leads into a range-extended piercing projectile."},{"name":"Grappling Pulsar","noun":"VerdanthSpecialThree","slug":"verdanthspecialthree-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":35,"base_hit_points":140,"estimated_hit_points":467.6,"descriptions":["Pull victims are slowed, then struck with rapid melee attacks."],"behavior":"The three-second Pulled modifier owns the forced-movement interval, then the phase uses the recovered nine-hit Fast Swipe while Puller cools."},{"name":"Molten Crawler","noun":"NomadRuption","slug":"nomadruption-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":36,"base_hit_points":90,"estimated_hit_points":300.6,"estimated_damage_min":14.6,"estimated_damage_max":23.4,"descriptions":["Hurls magma at nearby heroes to create damaging lava pools and uses melee close up."],"behavior":"Its phase selects per-target retained lava pools or the recovered melee fallback."},{"name":"Invincitron","noun":"NomadWithDrone","slug":"nomadwithdrone-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":110,"estimated_hit_points":367.4,"estimated_damage_min":14.6,"estimated_damage_max":23.4,"descriptions":["Has an orbiting drone that will shoot lasers at heroes.","At half health, will become invulnerable for a limited time."],"behavior":"One untargetable owner-bound NomadDrone uses the exact baseline SentryDroneLaser against the captain's current target and is deleted with its owner; the captain retains its strict-below-half ranked shield."},{"name":"Decelerator","noun":"NomadSnipe","slug":"nomadsnipe-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":27,"base_hit_points":60,"estimated_hit_points":200.4,"descriptions":["Can instantly inflict a crippling debuff on nearby heroes, slowing their movement and attack speed.","Chases after slowed heroes and uses a physical melee attack."],"behavior":"Its six-second slow now enters the modifier inventory, reaches the client with the exact movement and attack operands, and contributes its movement operand to authoritative hero motion before the melee pursuit."},{"name":"Acid Shell","noun":"NomadSpecialThree","slug":"nomadspecialthree-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":100,"estimated_hit_points":334,"descriptions":["Spits acid at the heroes while strafing between attacks.","Highly resistant to energy damage while mobile.","At half health, withdraws into its shell, becoming immune to physical damage and emitting area effect poison."],"behavior":"Its acid projectile, rank-shaped Energy Defense, bounded post-shot strafe-or-idle movement, half-health Physical-immunity Turtle phase, and ranked poison pulses are active."}]}}
